  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.0",
  "name": "Leopard-Instruct",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tLeopard-Instruct\n\t\n\nPaper | Github | Models-LLaVA | Models-Idefics2\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tSummaries\n\t\n\nLeopard-Instruct is a large instruction-tuning dataset, comprising 925K instances, with 739K specifically designed for text-rich, multiimage scenarios. It's been used to train Leopard-LLaVA [checkpoint]  and Leopard-Idefics2 [checkpoint].\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tLoading dataset\n\t\n\n\nto load the dataset without automatically downloading and process the images (Please run the following codes with datasets==2.18.0)\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/wyu1/Leopard-Instruct.",
  "alternateName": [
    "wyu1/Leopard-Instruct"
  ],
